
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no" />
  <meta name="description" content="黑盒子維修中心外送員專屬維修優惠：原廠螢幕維修89折、原廠電池維修79折、認證電池790元起。" />
  <meta property="og:title" content="外送員專屬維修優惠｜黑盒子維修中心" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="手機是外送員最重要的工作工具，螢幕、電池、充電異常立即交給黑盒子維修中心。" />
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <title>外送員專屬維修優惠｜黑盒子維修中心</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #07090d;
      --card: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.075);
      --card-strong: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      --text: #f6f7fb;
      --muted: #aeb6c7;
      --line: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.14);
      --brand: #f7b500;
      --brand-dark: #d89600;
      --green: #28d39b;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --shadow: 0 24px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.48);
      --radius-xl: 28px;
      --radius-lg: 22px;
      --radius-md: 16px;
      --max-width: 1120px;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", "Noto Sans TC", "PingFang TC", "Microsoft JhengHei", sans-serif;
      color: var(--text);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 18% 8%, rgba(247, 181, 0, 0.22), transparent 32%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 86% 22%, rgba(40, 211, 155, 0.16), transparent 26%),
        linear-gradient(135deg, #050608 0%, #0d1118 46%, #06080c 100%);
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    body::before {
      content: "";
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 52px 52px;
      mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(0,0,0,0.8), transparent 70%);
      z-index: -1;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .page {
      width: min(100%, var(--max-width));
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 28px 20px 120px;
    }

    .nav {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 42px;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      min-width: 0;
    }

    .brand-mark {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--brand), #ffe28a);
      color: #111;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(247, 181, 0, 0.25);
      flex: 0 0 auto;
    }

    .brand-text strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 16px;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    }

    .brand-text span {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 2px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    .nav-cta {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-height: 42px;
      padding: 0 18px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.09);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      color: var(--white);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
      transition: 0.22s ease;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .nav-cta:hover {
      transform: translateY(-2px);
      border-color: rgba(247, 181, 0, 0.55);
      background: rgba(247, 181, 0, 0.14);
    }

    .hero {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
      gap: 34px;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 42px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      padding: 9px 13px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(247, 181, 0, 0.32);
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(247, 181, 0, 0.12);
      color: #ffe3a1;
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .pulse {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--brand);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(247, 181, 0, 0.7);
      animation: pulse 1.8s infinite;
    }

    @keyframes pulse {
      0% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(247, 181, 0, 0.55); }
      70% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 12px rgba(247, 181, 0, 0); }
      100% { box-shadow: 0 0 0 0 rgba(247, 181, 0, 0); }
    }

    .hero h1 {
      max-width: 640px;
      font-size: clamp(42px, 6.2vw, 78px);
      line-height: 0.98;
      letter-spacing: -0.06em;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }

    .hero h1 span {
      color: var(--brand);
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 560px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: clamp(16px, 2vw, 19px);
      line-height: 1.8;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 14px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .primary-btn,
    .secondary-btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 10px;
      min-height: 54px;
      padding: 0 24px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 900;
      transition: 0.22s ease;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
    }

    .primary-btn {
      color: #111;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--brand), #ffe08a);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 36px rgba(247, 181, 0, 0.22);
    }

    .primary-btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      box-shadow: 0 24px 46px rgba(247, 181, 0, 0.32);
    }

    .secondary-btn {
      color: var(--white);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      border-color: var(--line);
    }

    .secondary-btn:hover {
      transform: translateY(-3px);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.13);
    }

    .hero-card {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 520px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12), rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045)),
        radial-gradient(circle at 30% 12%, rgba(247, 181, 0, 0.24), transparent 42%);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      overflow: hidden;
      backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
    }

    .hero-card::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      width: 220px;
      height: 220px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: rgba(247, 181, 0, 0.22);
      filter: blur(20px);
      right: -70px;
      top: -54px;
    }

    .phone-visual {
      position: absolute;
      left: 50%;
      top: 48%;
      width: min(255px, 62vw);
      height: 430px;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-7deg);
      border-radius: 38px;
      padding: 14px;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #232833, #07090d);
      box-shadow:
        inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.18),
        0 42px 80px rgba(0,0,0,0.55);
    }

    .phone-screen {
      position: relative;
      height: 100%;
      border-radius: 28px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(247,181,0,0.24), transparent 34%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #101521 0%, #05070a 100%);
      overflow: hidden;
      padding: 26px 20px;
    }

    .phone-notch {
      position: absolute;
      left: 50%;
      top: 11px;
      width: 82px;
      height: 23px;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: #05070a;
      opacity: 0.92;
    }

    .repair-status {
      margin-top: 28px;
      padding: 16px;
      border-radius: 20px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    }

    .repair-status small {
      display: block;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .repair-status strong {
      display: block;
      color: var(--white);
      font-size: 22px;
      line-height: 1.25;
    }

    .battery-bar {
      margin-top: 20px;
      width: 100%;
      height: 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .battery-bar span {
      display: block;
      width: 79%;
      height: 100%;
      border-radius: inherit;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--green), var(--brand));
    }

    .delivery-card {
      position: absolute;
      right: 20px;
      bottom: 28px;
      left: 20px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
      gap: 14px;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 16px;
      border-radius: 22px;
      background: rgba(5, 7, 10, 0.72);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.13);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    }

    .delivery-icon {
      width: 50px;
      height: 50px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: rgba(247,181,0,0.14);
      color: var(--brand);
    }

    .delivery-card strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 15px;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .delivery-card span {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    .section-head {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: end;
      gap: 18px;
      margin: 58px 0 22px;
    }

    .section-head h2 {
      font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 44px);
      line-height: 1.15;
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }

    .section-head p {
      max-width: 420px;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.8;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .offers {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .offer-card {
      position: relative;
      min-height: 280px;
      padding: 24px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.105), rgba(255,255,255,0.045));
      box-shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.22);
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: 0.24s ease;
    }

    .offer-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-6px);
      border-color: rgba(247,181,0,0.42);
    }

    .offer-card.featured {
      background:
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(247,181,0,0.18), rgba(255,255,255,0.045)),
        rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      border-color: rgba(247,181,0,0.42);
    }

    .offer-top {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .icon-box {
      width: 54px;
      height: 54px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      color: var(--brand);
    }

    .tag {
      padding: 7px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.09);
      color: #dfe4ef;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 800;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .offer-card h3 {
      font-size: 21px;
      line-height: 1.35;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .price-line {
      display: flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      gap: 7px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .price-line strong {
      font-size: clamp(42px, 5vw, 56px);
      line-height: 1;
      letter-spacing: -0.06em;
      color: var(--brand);
    }

    .price-line span {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .offer-card p {
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.72;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .process {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .step {
      padding: 20px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-md);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    }

    .step-number {
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      background: var(--brand);
      color: #111;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 950;
    }

    .step strong {
      display: block;
      font-size: 16px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .step span {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .notice {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
      gap: 24px;
      align-items: center;
      margin-top: 18px;
      padding: 24px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      border: 1px solid rgba(247,181,0,0.28);
      background: rgba(247,181,0,0.09);
    }

    .notice h3 {
      font-size: 22px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .notice p {
      color: #d9deea;
      line-height: 1.75;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .store-info {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }

    .store-card {
      padding: 22px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
    }

    .store-card h3 {
      font-size: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      color: var(--white);
    }

    .store-card p {
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.8;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    .footer-cta {
      margin-top: 52px;
      padding: 42px 28px;
      border-radius: 34px;
      text-align: center;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, rgba(247,181,0,0.22), transparent 42%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.105), rgba(255,255,255,0.045));
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }

    .footer-cta h2 {
      font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 48px);
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
      line-height: 1.16;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    .footer-cta p {
      max-width: 620px;
      margin: 0 auto 24px;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .floating-booking {
      position: fixed;
      left: 50%;
      bottom: 18px;
      width: min(calc(100% - 32px), 520px);
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      z-index: 20;
      display: none;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 14px;
      padding: 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(10, 12, 17, 0.82);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.16);
      backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
      box-shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.42);
    }

    .floating-booking span {
      padding-left: 12px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .floating-booking a {
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      min-height: 44px;
      padding: 0 18px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: #111;
      background: var(--brand);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 950;
    }

    .svg-icon {
      width: 26px;
      height: 26px;
      stroke: currentColor;
      fill: none;
      stroke-width: 2;
      stroke-linecap: round;
      stroke-linejoin: round;
    }

    @media (max-width: 880px) {
      .page {
        padding-top: 20px;
      }

      .hero {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .hero-card {
        min-height: 500px;
      }

      .section-head {
        align-items: flex-start;
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      .offers,
      .process,
      .store-info {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .notice {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .notice .primary-btn {
        width: 100%;
      }

      .floating-booking {
        display: flex;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 520px) {
      .nav-cta {
        display: none;
      }

      .hero h1 {
        font-size: 46px;
      }

      .hero-actions a {
        width: 100%;
      }

      .hero-card {
        min-height: 460px;
      }

      .phone-visual {
        height: 390px;
        width: 225px;
      }

      .delivery-card {
        bottom: 18px;
      }

      .offer-card {
        min-height: auto;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="page">
    <nav class="nav" aria-label="主選單">
      <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="黑盒子維修中心首頁">
        <div class="brand-mark">BB</div>
        <div class="brand-text">
          <strong>黑盒子維修中心</strong>
          <span>Professional Repair Service</span>
        </div>
      </a>
      <a class="nav-cta" href="https://blackboxrepair.github.io/bookingonline/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">立即預約</a>
    </nav>

    <section class="hero" id="top">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow"><span class="pulse"></span> 外送員專屬維修優惠</div>
        <h1>手機不能停，<br><span>接單不中斷。</span></h1>
        <p>
          螢幕破裂、電池耗電、續航不穩，都可能影響外送接單效率。
          黑盒子維修中心提供外送員專屬優惠，讓你的工作機快速恢復穩定狀態。
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="primary-btn" href="https://blackboxrepair.github.io/bookingonline/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">立即預約維修</a>
          <a class="secondary-btn" href="#offers">查看優惠內容</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-card" aria-label="手機維修專業視覺">
        <div class="phone-visual">
          <div class="phone-screen">
            <div class="phone-notch"></div>
            <div class="repair-status">
              <small>REPAIR STATUS</small>
              <strong>快速檢測中<br>保持接單續航</strong>
              <div class="battery-bar"><span></span></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="delivery-card">
          <div class="delivery-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg class="svg-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path d="M5 17h10" />
              <path d="M16 17h2.5a1.5 1.5 0 0 0 1.35-.84l1.15-2.3a2 2 0 0 0 .21-.9V9h-4l-2-3H9a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v9" />
              <circle cx="7" cy="17" r="2" />
              <circle cx="17" cy="17" r="2" />
              <path d="M9 10h4" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <strong>給每天高頻使用手機的你</strong>
            <span>外送導航、接單、通話、支付，一支穩定手機就是工作效率。</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="offers">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>優惠方案</h2>
        <p>到店出示外送員相關證明，即可享有專屬維修優惠。實際維修項目依現場檢測與機型報價為準。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="offers">
        <article class="offer-card">
          <div class="offer-top">
            <div class="icon-box" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg class="svg-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <rect x="7" y="2" width="10" height="20" rx="2" />
                <path d="M11 18h2" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="tag">原廠零件</span>
          </div>
          <h3>原廠螢幕維修</h3>
          <div class="price-line"><strong>89</strong><span>折</span></div>
          <p>螢幕破裂、觸控異常、顯示異常，協助恢復清晰畫面與穩定操作。</p>
        </article>

        <article class="offer-card featured">
          <div class="offer-top">
            <div class="icon-box" aria-hidden="true">
              <svg class="svg-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <rect x="3" y="7" width="17" height="10" rx="2" />
                <path d="M22 11v2" />
                <path d="M7 11h7" />
              </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="tag">外送首選</span>
          </div>
          <h3>原廠電池維修</h3>
          <div class="price-line"><strong>79</strong><span>折</span></div>
          <p>改善耗電快、電量跳動、低電量關機，讓導航與接單更安心。</p>
        </article>

        <article class="offer-card">
          <div class="offer-top">
